==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Zir Zeal]] (150%) spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Zir Zeal]] (250%) spawns.
**2 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] to resurface both the boss Dread Bore and the Zir Zeal. Using anti-Zombie CC such as [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Weedwacker]] or [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Ectoweight]] is highly recommended. Make sure your attacking units are good enough to deal with Dark Otter.

